<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84915" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ̆καρπ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fruitful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλωή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.122
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				24.221
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					9.7
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν π. οἰνάνθας βότρυν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					230
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δένδρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					86c
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Insomn.</u>
				90
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέφανος μύρτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					328
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				3.726
			</span></i>; <i>rich in fruit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φρύγες πολυκαρπότατοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.49
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					2175
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύκαρπον, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραταιόγονον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.65
			</span></i>, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.132
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύγονον ἄρρεν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.4
			</span></i>.</div>
